00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:04.500
endpoint to invoke a container.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.450
Let's open it.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.260
It's running.

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:08.980
That's it.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:12.030
It's that simple to deploy
an existing container

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:15.540
image to Cloud Run.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:20.670
So yes, we are introducing at
